Privacy Policy for Billionaire King

Billionaire King is a mobile game developed by Carlo Macor.

This Privacy Policy explains how information is handled when you use the Billionaire King application.

1. Developer

Developer: Carlo Macor
Contact email: carlo.macor@libero.it

For any questions regarding privacy or the handling of information, you can contact the developer at the email address above.

2. Personal information provided by the user

Billionaire King does not require users to create an account, log in, provide their name, email address, telephone number, postal address, or other directly identifying personal information.

The application does not contain:

user registration;
user accounts;
login systems;
social-network login;
in-app purchases;
payment processing;
a developer-operated server or database containing personal user information.
3. Game progress and locally stored information

Billionaire King stores certain information locally on the user's device in order to provide the game functionality.

This may include, for example:

game progress;
levels or game status;
virtual currency or resources;
game settings;
other information necessary to preserve the player's progress.

This information is stored locally by the application and is not directly transmitted by Billionaire King to a database operated by the developer.

Deleting the application or its local application data may result in the loss of locally stored game progress.

4. Unity Analytics

Billionaire King uses Unity Analytics to understand how the game is used and to monitor and improve the game.

Analytics events may include information concerning game sessions and interactions with game features, such as game starts, gameplay activity, session information, and other events configured by the developer.

Unity Analytics may also process technical information associated with the device or application. Depending on the Unity services and configuration used, this may include information such as device identifiers, IP address, device model, operating system, application information and advertising identifiers.

The developer does not use Unity Analytics to request the user's name, email address, telephone number, postal address, or other directly identifying information.

For information about how Unity processes information relating to players and app users, please refer to Unity's Game Player and App User Privacy Policy.

5. Advertising — Unity Ads

Billionaire King uses Unity Ads to display advertising.

The game may display rewarded video advertisements. These advertisements are optional: the player can choose to watch a rewarded advertisement in order to receive the corresponding in-game reward.

Unity Ads may process certain technical and advertising-related information, including information concerning the device, advertising identifiers, IP address, delivery of advertisements, and interaction with advertisements. Depending on applicable law and configuration, Unity may use such information for advertising, measurement, fraud prevention and personalization purposes.

Unity provides privacy controls and information concerning personalized advertising within its advertising services.

For more information, please refer to Unity's Privacy Policy.

6. No in-app purchases

Billionaire King does not offer in-app purchases.

The game does not collect or process payment information or credit/debit card information.

7. Children's privacy

Billionaire King is intended for a general audience and is not specifically directed at children.

The application does not knowingly request personal information from children.

Because the application uses Unity Analytics and Unity Ads, information may nevertheless be processed by these third-party services as described in this Privacy Policy and in Unity's privacy documentation.

8. Sharing of information

Carlo Macor does not sell users' personal information.

Billionaire King does not operate its own service for collecting or selling personal user information.

Information may nevertheless be processed by Unity and its service providers in connection with Unity Analytics and Unity Ads. Unity's privacy documentation describes the categories of information that may be processed and the circumstances in which information may be shared with service providers, advertisers and advertising partners.

9. Data retention and deletion

Game progress and other gameplay information stored by Billionaire King are stored locally on the user's device.

The developer does not maintain a separate database containing this locally stored game progress.

Analytics and advertising-related information processed by Unity is subject to Unity's applicable data retention policies.

Users can remove locally stored game data by deleting the application or clearing its application data, subject to the operating system's functionality.

For requests concerning information processed by Unity, users may consult Unity's privacy documentation and available privacy controls.

10. User privacy rights

Depending on the user's country or jurisdiction, users may have rights concerning their personal information, including rights of access, deletion, objection, restriction or other rights provided by applicable data protection law.

